00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Step 9: Mobile vs web

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:08.739
Same app, two layouts. Wider than 860 px you get the Web app; narrower, the Mobile app.

3
00:00:08.739 --> 00:00:14.979
Web: a sidebar, wide tables and the form side by side with the live estimate.

4
00:00:14.979 --> 00:00:21.218
Mobile: bottom tabs, cards instead of tables, wallets in a bottom sheet. Force either with ?view=web or ?view=mobile.

